      "writtenOn": "2020-01-14T03:18:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this true? If we enter recovery mode then AP will be in S0 and EC will be in RO then in this case, as I know the sensor is still enabled?",
      "revId": "8fc98f0ba30c87c702381862562430e29e686632",
