      "writtenOn": "2020-01-20T01:06:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Once again, i2c is not meant to be discovered at run time: the bus topology is supposed to be well defined at build time.\nIf we can not use sku_id to identify which sensors we are using, can we  add a new property to  cbi eeprom to indicate which sensors we are using?",
      "parentUuid": "5008fb1d_ac555d3c",
      "revId": "8fc98f0ba30c87c702381862562430e29e686632",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
