      "message": "Hey Lu, thank you for putting this prototype together.\n\nUltimately it doesn\u0027t look it is going to work. I updated b/137567681 with reasoning (but main from this CL).\n\nLooks like we are going to need to keep using sku_id to differentiate the different boards. Otherwise we need to solve the HWID problem (of getting this 2nd-sourced sensor information into the HWID) in addition to the start up concerns.",
